{{Quote | ''The grove sparkles with fairy magic!''}}

Fairy Grove is a special field in Pokémon Inritum.

It's active in the Fairy Grove area of Zapffe Falls.

==General Effects==

*'''All Fairy Moves''': Power increased by 30%.
*'''All Dragon Moves''': Damage reduced by 50%.
*'''Grounded Pokémon''': Immune to status conditions.

==Moves Affected==

===Fairy-Type Moves===

*'''Moonblast, Dazzling Gleam, Play Rough, Draining Kiss, Disarming Voice, Fairy Wind, Sparkling Aria, Misty Explosion''': Power increased by 20-30%.

===Sound Moves===

*'''Hyper Voice, Sing, Perish Song, Round''': Power increased by 10%.

===Healing Moves===

*'''Moonlight, Wish, Healing Wish''': Healing boosted.

